<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>PAYE from taxable pay</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>PAYE tax bands for resident individuals, from 1 July 2023 (Kenya Revenue Authority; Finance Act 2023):</p><table border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center;"><tr><th style="padding:4px 10px;">Monthly taxable pay (Ksh)</th><th style="padding:4px 10px;">Rate</th></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 10px;">First \(24\,000\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\(10\%\)</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 10px;">Next \(8333\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\(25\%\)</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 10px;">Next \(467\,667\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\(30\%\)</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 10px;">Next \(300\,000\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\(32.5\%\)</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 10px;">Above \(800\,000\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\(35\%\)</td></tr></table><p>Personal relief: Ksh \(2400\) a month, taken off the tax. PAYE is never negative.</p><p>{@nm@}'s taxable pay is Ksh \({@ksh(tp)@}\) a month.</p><p>(a) Find the tax before relief.</p><p>Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p><p>(b) Find the PAYE after personal relief of Ksh \(2400\).</p><p>Ksh [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p><p>Give each answer to the nearest shilling, or exactly in cents.</p>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Each slice of pay is taxed at its own band's rate.</p><p>Split Ksh \({@ksh(tp)@}\) into the bands:</p><ul><li>first \({@ksh(min(tp,24000))@}\) at \(10\%\): \({@ksh(min(tp,24000)/10)@}\)</li>[[if test="is(tp>24000)"]]<li>next \({@ksh(min(tp,32333)-24000)@}\) at \(25\%\): \({@ksh((min(tp,32333)-24000)/4)@}\)</li>[[/if]][[if test="is(tp>32333)"]]<li>next \({@ksh(min(tp,500000)-32333)@}\) at \(30\%\): \({@ksh((min(tp,500000)-32333)*3/10)@}\)</li>[[/if]]</ul><p>Tax before relief \(= {@ksh(taxf(tp))@}\).</p><p>(a) Tax before relief \(= {@ksh(tx)@}\) shillings.</p><p>(b) PAYE \(= {@ksh(tx)@} - 2400 = {@ksh(py)@}\) shillings.</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[kgrp(n) := block([s, out, k], s: string(n), k: slength(s), if k < 5 then s else (out: "", while k > 3 do (out: sconcat("\\,", substring(s, k-2, k+1), out), k: k-3), sconcat(substring(s, 1, k+1), out)));
ksh(v) := block([c, w, f], c: floor(100*v+1/2), w: floor(c/100), f: c-100*w, if f = 0 then kgrp(w) else sconcat(kgrp(w), ".", if f < 10 then "0" else "", string(f)));
dd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else if integerp(10*v) then dispdp(float(v),1) else if integerp(100*v) then dispdp(float(v),2) else if integerp(1000*v) then dispdp(float(v),3) else dispdp(float(v),4);
taxf(x) := min(x,24000)*10/100 + max(0,min(x,32333)-24000)*25/100 + max(0,min(x,500000)-32333)*30/100 + max(0,min(x,800000)-500000)*65/200 + max(0,x-800000)*35/100;
payef(x) := max(0, taxf(x)-2400);
ix: 1+rand(10);
/* Design: uses the real KRA 2023 PAYE bands. Taxable pay tp; tx tax before relief; py PAYE. Source: original. */
L: [28500,41200,57750,64800,86400,103900,132000,47300,75650,158800];
tp: L[ix];
nm: ["Achieng","Kiprono","Wanjiru","Omondi","Nekesa","Mutua","Chebet","Barasa","Njeri","Hassan"][ix];
tx: taxf(tp);
py: payef(tp);
top: if tp<=32333 then 25 else 30;
/* diagnostics */
fl: tp*top/100;
t10: tp/10;
b2: 2400+(tp-24000)*3/10;
ar: tx-2400;
ann: tx-28800;
txr: tx+2400;
g1: tx+250;
g2: py+250;
g3: py+600;
]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
