  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Commercial Arithmetic III: PAYE from taxable pay</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Essential 2.4 (e): Find the tax before relief and the PAYE on a monthly taxable pay from the KRA PAYE bands (Finance Act 2023) and personal relief.</p><p id="edition">Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
